--- stdout ---
Usage: managed-machine <command> [options]

Portable command boundary. Default output is compact JSON Lines on stdout;
diagnostics are one JSON object per line on stderr.

Commands
platform     Report the host's canonical platform identifier
synthetic    test-only outcomes

Options
-h, --help    Show usage; takes precedence over every action and never changes the machine
--json        Return results as one JSON document
--human       Render results in a readable form

Exit codes: 0 success, 1 runtime failure, 2 usage or validation error,
3 completed evaluation with findings, 4 incomplete evaluation.
